ble to produce a build artifact from it.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 36 slack thread window path handl channel releas date 2026 08 10 2026 08 1010 19 evan window build have been fail on path separ the ingest logic ha backslash assumpt bake in that don t hold up on window 2026 08 1010 34 bob quick search and replac for the separ or someth more thorough 2026 08 1010 39 evan more thorough move the path handl to be o awar instead of hardcod so this doesn t come back the next time we touch it 2026 08 1010 41 bob lgtm 2026 08 10 12 46 charli what about the temp directori i rememb some older code assum a linux style path there too 2026 08 10 13 00 evan alreadi on it fix that in the same pas so it respect the o level temp locat instead of guess 2026 08 10 13 01 alic how s this look for a first test build 2026 08 10 13 03 evan onc the path fix hold up under test i should be abl to produc a build artifact from it\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8fd13168a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-10-windows-path-handling.md\", \"id\": \"861669a2b04e3fa7\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2842154225023879, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08388466786055421, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75165385, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-10-windows-path-handling.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8fd13168a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-10-windows-path-handling.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-10-windows-path-handling.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1051, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:11\", \"token_count\": 322, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-23\\n\\n# Windows Backslash Path Handling Notes\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2023\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-19 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-10)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the path-handling fix made 2026-08-10 for CIPH-39 (Windows Compatibility).\\n\\n## Issue\\n\\nPath arguments containing backslashes (Windows-style, e.g. `C:\\\\docs\\\\input.pdf`) were mishandled by the CLI's path parser, which had only been exercised against forward-slash paths on Linux/macOS.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-23\\n\\n# Windows Backslash Path Handling Notes\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2023\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-19 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-10)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the path-handling fix made 2026-08-10 for CIPH-39 (Windows Compatibility).\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nPath arguments are now normalized to the platform-native separator before they reach the file-loading code, rather than assuming forward slashes everywhere.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-23\\n\\n# Windows Backslash Path Handling Notes\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2023\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-19 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-10)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the path-handling fix made 2026-08-10 for CIPH-39 (Windows Compatibility).\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nThis note covers path-string handling only. It does not cover code signing or Windows Defender/SmartScreen behavior — those are separate, later concerns for CIPH-39 and are not addressed here.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 23 window backslash path handl note owner evan document key doc 2023 last updat 2026 08 19 retrospect cover 2026 08 10 retrospect note on the path handl fix made 2026 08 10 for ciph 39 window compat issu path argument contain backslash window style e g c doc input pdf were mishandl by the cli s path parser which had onli been exercis against forward slash path on linux maco sourc id src gdoc 23 window backslash path handl note owner evan document key doc 2023 last updat 2026 08 19 retrospect cover 2026 08 10 retrospect note on the path handl fix made 2026 08 10 for ciph 39 window compat fix path argument are now normal to the platform nativ separ befor they reach the file load code rather than assum forward slash everywher sourc id src gdoc 23 window backslash path handl note owner evan document key doc 2023 last updat 2026 08 19 retrospect cover 2026 08 10 retrospect note on the path handl fix made 2026 08 10 for ciph 39 window compat scope this note cover path string handl onli it doe not cover code sign or window defend smartscreen behavior those are separ later concern for ciph 39 and are not address here\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9c4421a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-19-Windows-Compatibility-Review.md\", \"id\": \"c27e5ca8f09d8c95\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2762277680671117, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07993032295301668, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73425514, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-19-Windows-Compatibility-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9c4421a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-19-Windows-Compatibility-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-19-Windows-Compatibility-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 849, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:23\", \"token_count\": 390, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Sourc